# SHA-256 of the AppImage packaging tools, verified by fetch-tools.sh.
#
# linuxdeploy, linuxdeploy-plugin-qt and appimagetool only publish "continuous"
# builds: the same URL serves a new binary whenever upstream pushes. Pinning the
# digests here means a packaging change upstream shows up as a failed download
# instead of silently altering a release. Refresh them deliberately, once per
# release cycle: re-download the six files, check the result, and paste the new
# digests in.
#
# Downloaded from, respectively:
#   https://github.com/linuxdeploy/linuxdeploy/releases/download/continuous/
#   https://github.com/linuxdeploy/linuxdeploy-plugin-qt/releases/download/continuous/
#   https://github.com/AppImage/appimagetool/releases/download/continuous/
#
# Pinned 2026-10-01 (appimagetool git 8c8c91f, build 295).
